OL,3,GNEWSAPlanes grounded at Gatwick after
OL,4,Aaircraft stuck on runway
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlights at Gatwick Airport were brought
OL,7,Fto a standstill for nearly an hour
OL,8,Fafter a plane became stuck on the
OL,9,Frunway.
OL,11,FA Gatwick spokesperson said the runway
OL,12,Fwas closed for 50 minutes on Friday
OL,13,Fafternoon because of a "technical issue
OL,14,Fwith a departing vehicle".
OL,16,FThe airport said the plane was towed
OL,17,Faway from the runway, which "reopened
OL,18,Fshortly afterwards following a full
OL,19,Fsafety inspection".
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
